	(text "RP2350A as Raspberry Pi's minimal design (RP-006440): the core\nsupply is the chip's own switching regulator, VREG_LX through\nL701 to +1V1, which VREG_FB senses and DVDD takes. VREG_AVDD\nis +3V3 through R706 and C718.\n\nOne 100n at each IOVDD pin (C701-C706); C714 4u7 at VREG_VIN.\n\nADC_AVDD is +3V3 filtered by R703 and C716 (+3V3A).\n\nBOOTSEL: SW1 on sheet 05 pulls QSPI_SS low through R701 at\nreset.\n\nThe encoder: ENC_DO on GPIO6, ENC_SCK on GPIO4, ENC_CS on GPIO5, ENC_OUT on GPIO7. SPI0 would want the data on GPIO4 and the clock on GPIO6.\n\nGPIO19-24 go to the expansion header (sheet 05)." (exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.0200 97.7900 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "64d33332-aaea-52c8-8390-55237b23c2a0"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
